WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.240
You mentioned some people would escape?

2
00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:04.320
Oh yeah!

3
00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:04.860
Yeah!

4
00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:05.400
Okay.

5
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:09.180
Tell me some more about that.

6
00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:14.900
We decided that we wanted to go on Saturday nights to the football game in Baton Rouge.

7
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:19.700
So, we got in touch with a worker here and if he knew of anybody down the road,

8
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:23.680
friend of his, that would take us to the football game at night . . . on Saturday nights, you see.

9
00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:29.880
So he arranged it so we would catch . . . Go down the hole, you know, the end of the fence?

10
00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:31.820
That’s what we’d call the hole.

11
00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:36.620
Right in the end there, we had cut the wire there in a way that you could crawl through there, you see.

12
00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:44.920
So, that guy would come over there, and we’d turn around, and we’d get some newspapers and curl them up,

13
00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:49.280
see, and put them in the middle of the road and put some gravel on top from the road, you see.

14
00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:54.540
And when he come, he would stop there, because he knew we were there, see.

15
00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:58.440
And then that’s when we’d get out, and get in the car, and away we’d go, you see.

16
00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:04.000
And then we’d come in at night, after we . . . After we would go to the football game,

17
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.140
then we’d maybe hit the bars in Baton Rouge.

18
00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:09.140
We’d go through the bars. [laughing]
